  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="62183799-6c9a-50ae-b313-64d6aeada33e" activityNameId="19b78b48-e4c1-55fb-b7b8-c3d3f14fabab" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Photovoltaic laminate, single-Si, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic laminate, single-Si, at plant
Unit process raw data for 1 m2 of PV laminate. Investigated for the production of solar laminates with 60 solar cells and an area of 1.6m2.;
Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, monocrystalline, silicon; 
UUID: fae12c0e-040a-454e-97d0-f813453666f5
Production of the cell matrix, cutting of foils and washing of glass, production of laminate and isolation. Data for direct air emissions (except NVMOC) and water emissions were not available.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average production technology.
Time period: Date of data investigation. Some older data from 2001. Demand of electricity updated for 2018.
Production volume: Approximately 99000 MW for total c-Si in 2018
Sampling: Environmental reports, direct contacts with factory representatives and publication of plant data. 
Extrapolations: Assumption for laminate production with data for panels. Materials for frames neglected. Extrapolation of European LCI inventory data by adjusting the electricity mix.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fae12c0e-040a-454e-97d0-f813453666f5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="8c32309a-0e1f-5c1b-84d8-e09321bbb666" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
